architecture integrating multi-messenger astrophysics, post-quantum
cryptography, and nonlinear quantum field dynamics. The Quantum Consciousness
Acceleration Kernel (QCAK) is formulated as an anisotropic nonlinear
Schrödinger-type PDE with explicit Hamiltonian structure, enabling stable,
symplectic evolution of encrypted astrophysical tensor fields.

